DESCRIPTION:This event will be welcoming aspiring students to the Bloomfie
 ld Campus for a guided tour experience. This will expose them to college 
 life and will inspire them to pursue higher education. This event will su
 pport things like student retention\, student interest and engagement\, a
 nd an introduction to Bloomfield College\, and what the CHAMPIONS Program
  is and why we're here. Alongside the tour of Bloomfield College\, food a
 nd beverages will be provided as well. \n\nHosted by: Bloomfield PBI-C CH
 AMPIONS Program\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montcl
 air.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12521580
DTEND:20260803T150000Z
DTSTAMP:20260801T034954Z
DTSTART:20260803T140000Z
GEO:40.795190;-74.194830
LOCATION:Talbot Hall Student Center
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:PBI-C CHAMPIONS Time to Think: College Tour
UID:https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12521580
URL:https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12521580
